        "payload": "tree 7c640ea57ae09a5fe75d275d278a0c34f19c29bb\nparent 2b5b6fe231ff45a09d9e24411e4420d51ed45cab\nauthor will <will@256k1.dev> 1793094685 +0000\ncommitter will <will@256k1.dev> 1793094924 +0000\n\nci: Monitor Windows signing certificate expiry\n\nCheck the signing certificate on master weekly so maintainers have time\nto renew it before Windows release signing is affected. Open an issue\nwithin 30 days of expiry, including certificate details and the checked\ncommit. Treat an existing open or closed alert for that expiry as\nacknowledgement to avoid repeated issues.\n",
